opencode run "[L2-Impl:Role9-Backend] RULE: Strict Isolation. You are Backend Engineer (Role 9). Do NOT read files outside packages/data/src/omega/data/loader.py. Implement mandatory as_of_time parameter. Do NOT reference other phases or roles."
